cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software or its experimental data, please cite it using the metadata below."
title: "Ascend-FFT: Hardware-Mapped Complex FFT on Huawei Ascend NPUs"
type: software
authors:
  - given-names: "Teng"
    family-names: "Wang"
    email: "wangt635@ustc.edu.cn"
    affiliation: "High Efficient Intelligent Computing Lab, Suzhou Institute for Advanced Research of USTC, Suzhou, China"
repository-code: "https://github.com/TruNcat3/ascend-fft"
url: "https://github.com/TruNcat3/ascend-fft"
version: 0.1.0
date-released: 2026-10-03
abstract: >-
  An AscendC library and reproducible artifact implementing a radix-2
  decimation-in-time complex fp32 FFT for the Ascend910_9382 SoC. The design
  space, Context/Plan/Transform API shape, batch-parallel decomposition, and
  cost-model-driven plan selection are ported from cuButterfly.
keywords:
  - FFT
  - Ascend
  - AscendC
  - NPU
  - radix-2
  - batch folding
  - cost model
  - design space search
  - space-time parallelism
